  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `site/static/icons/act-report.png`: new, a copy of `assets/ui/act-report.png` (added by 984b2af6c).\n- `site/static/icons/LICENSES.txt`: a copy of `assets/ui/LICENSES.md`. With the icon in place, the test reached its notice check, and that check failed too. The site copy did not have these rows:\n  - The `act-report` attribution: the Tabler `banner` glyph (#1696).\n  - The AI provider transport crates (#1945).\n\n`test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` requires that the two copies are byte-identical to `assets/ui/`.\n\n## Readings\n\n- `ZOLA=<zola 0.23.6> python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests`: 62 tests, OK. Before the change: 2 failures in `test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app`.\n- `cmp` of each copy with its source in `assets/ui/`: identical.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n`test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` (`site/tests/test_guide_icons.py`).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No Rust build or gate: the change touches no code.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2801\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
